# HS Group Design System

**Homepage is the law.** Extend only. Never redesign. Never invent a new visual language.

## Do
- Reuse Homepage: `container-wide`, `section-label`, `section-title`, `btn-primary`, `btn-secondary`, cards (`rounded-[28px]`), shadows, hover lift, GSAP fade-up/scroll reveal
- Spacing: mobile `72px`, tablet `100px`, desktop `140px` section padding; grid gap `32px`, card gap `24px`
- Colors: engineering blue `#218cce`, accent green, navy, white, light gray borders only
- Icons: Lucide only, minimal, enterprise tone
- Images: premium engineering photography, consistent cinematic grading
- Motion: fade up, slide up, scale, image zoom, counter, parallax, light sweep, hover lift — subtle only
- Alternate layouts per page: image left/right, centered, editorial, split

## Do Not
- Redesign approved sections or layout structure
- Change typography, colors, radius, buttons, containers, or spacing scale
- Introduce glassmorphism, neumorphism, SaaS/agency/startup UI patterns
- Add random gradients, bounce/rotate/flash animations, or new card/button styles
- Create page-specific design languages

## Before Shipping
Verify: matches Homepage containers, typography, buttons, cards, shadows, radius, hover, colors, animation, and enterprise feel.

## Reference Files
- Tokens/utilities: `src/app/globals.css`
- Layout patterns: `src/components/sections/` (homepage sections)
- About shared tokens: `src/components/sections/about/constants.ts`
